<title>UK: United Utilities plans 17 mln stg benefits.</title>
<headline>United Utilities plans 17 mln stg benefits.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's United Utilities Plc announced a 17 million stg package of new measures on Thursday that would benefit customers of North West Water.</p>
<p>The package is a part of United's move to share North West Water's outperformance between shareholders and customers.</p>
</text>
